What was the primary objective of the research that compared e-Reader and tablet usage among bachelor students at the Baden-Wuerttemberg Cooperative State University in Mannheim?,"When rating the usability of tablets for the 
personal  learning  processes,  tablets  are  rated  higher  in  comparison  to  e-Readers 
