generate questions without using a semantic  web database. Using a semantic web
[e.g., ConceptNet, DBPedia (http://de.dbpedia.org)] or a lexical database [WordNet
for English (Miller, 1995) and GermaNet for Ge rman (http://www.sfs.uni-tuebinge
n.de/GermaNet)], the lesson topics can be ﬁlled with other meaningful semantically
