""willpower."" This tactic is in response to the model presented by Janet. It represents  a major  shift  from  her thinking observed  in earlier consul-
tation sessions. Previously, Grace expressed some doubts about the value
of eliciting from  the children rather than ""telling"" them. Her impulse to

