learning. For the first time, we received a request for the trans-
fer of trainer competencies that we could not meet with our pre-
vious approach. Our previous approach consisted of a training 
with  15  days  of  presence,  distributed  over  three  five-day  mod-
ules. However, the customer presented us with the challenge of 

