is much higher than that of photography (SD = 1.401), and music (SD = 1.519). Many parents fail to “guide their children to pay attention to dramas in everyday life”
and have less chance of “humming impressive drama with their c hildren”. However,
very few parents who like dramas will be intended to guide and do with their chil-
