the left side of the house, he knows he is to hurry about what must be done so that we 
may go back inside. He goes through the steps and we are on our merry way. If we 
go to the right side of the house, my dog knows that we are going to take a leisurely 
walk that may include opportunities to enjoy exotic smel ls on the sidewalk, to have 
chance encounters with other dogs, and to stretch his way into wide open grassy runs 
through the park. Our students need the freedom to break off of the leash and stop 
and smell the hydrant. HYBRIDIZATION AND MATHEMATIZATION

