schools is only 5.4 hours per week compared with an average of  29 hours per week 
at upper secondary schools (Barstad et al., 2007). A low priority for library use in 
elementary  education  has  also  been  reported  in  other  European  countries 
(McCutcheon, 2010; Streatfield, S haper, Markless, & Rae-Scott, 2011). Education 
