here is – what was informing their ascertaining and logic that took them right to 
cognitive  intellectual  deficit,  as  opposed  to  con sidering  inter  personal  cultural 
difference? Among  educators,  administrators,  researchers,  and  scholars  alike,  who  would 
embrace cognitive intellectual deficit – failure or inability to  learn logic making, this 
