other and to witness how that transforms teach ing and learning in the classroom and
beyond. Recently we have begun training using the actionable practices we have outlined,
collecting stories in the form of these short vignettes as the teache rs reﬂect on the
teaching and learning experiences they are creating in their own contexts. We ask

