What led Wayne to seek out his own professional development in sustainability rather than relying on institutional opportunities?,"This perspective influenced his view of what 
sustainability was, and how it could be addressed in his teaching programme where 
he looked at architec ture, building materials and systems. The second most influential factor affecting Wayne’s view of sustainability was, 
in his view, his personal beliefs and values about sustainability. The first of these 

