gies and ﬂexible furnishings in the classroom. The main purpose of X-Space is to
provide an ideal learning environment for students and to support active and col-
laborative learning. 1.1 Objective

The scope of this study is to examine the factors that affect students’ acceptance and
usage of X-Space based on The Extended Uniﬁed Th eory Of Acceptance And Use
Of Technology (UTAUT2) model. The objective of this research is to explore the

