as a global tourism destination due to its proximity to the Bunaken Marine Park and 
as an important regional centre for government, agricul ture, mining and commerce 
in  the  region. It  increasingly  resembles  any  large  city  with  popular  shopping 
complexes,  fast  food,  chic  hotels  and  trendy  restaurants. As  the  city  grows,  so 
