to enjoy more freedom, the Chinese political system has remained highly central-
ized. Under such a sociopolitical context, the implementation was fundamentally
shaped by the top Chinese policymakers to improve the overall quality of the  teaching
workforce and thus to enhance China’s national achievement and competitiveness. 80

