process with regard to education is essential for school supply and demand, like 
the introduction of mandatory s chooling requirements in the nineteenth century 
in many Western countries. In addition, control variables such as pupils‘ and/or 
their  parents‘  socio-economic  background  help  shed  some  light  on  potentially 
