dations  remain  pertinent  in  the  national  discourse  on  the  post-2015  education 
agenda. Indeed, the research output, as mentioned above, provided the content for 
the first comprehensive research-based book on pre-tertiary education in Ba ngladesh. The Bangladesh CREATE Team engaged in wide-ranging communication and 
