PHYSICAL EDUCATION STUDIES FINDINGS FOR FIRST YEAR 

Overall, the examination task was regarded by the teachers and students involved  
as an appropriate means of assessment for the PES course. The task effectively en-
compassed conceptual, practical and reflective aspects and was able to be adapted 
for application and implementation in the  varied activity contexts. The researchers 
