to prevent another charge. Plagiarism  is  often  treated  as  a  singular  issue  when  it  is,  in  fact,  quite 
complex. Unintentional plagiarism is a symptom of a problem, but many 
treat it with retribution rather than rehabilitation. In most cases, the problems 

