"According to the classification proposed by Horz and Ulrich (2015), how are educational media categorized, and what are some examples of each category?","We  then  go  through  typical  E-Learning  offers  at  the  university. This  is 
followed  by  criteria  for  optimal  blended  learning  formats  and  an  explanation  of  the 
flipped or inverted classroom concept. At the end, there are the usual practice exam-
ples. The use of media to supplement university teaching is a traditional method of increas-
ing student learning success. In addition to the rhetorical skills of the teacher, this also 
involves his or her presentation skills (see Chap. 5) as well as the quality of the media 
and  media  content. Possible  media  can  be  differentiated  according  to  Horz  and  Ulrich 
(2015) into:

