"What was the prevailing view among Finnish teachers and education professors regarding the possibility of other countries successfully adopting Finland's educational approach, and what culturally-specific example did one professor use to illustrate the limits of such transfer?","They  also  experienced  PISA  tourism,  but  believed  that  these  visitors  came 
