doctoral educators engaged in creating and supporting t he development of innovative 
portfolio  doctorates? And  what  is  their  notion  of  a  ‘professional’  doctorate  and 
‘doctorateness’? When do studies make a ripple and/or a splash? How do we think 
about and address crucial issues surrounding the outcomes and impact of our research? How does theorising practice play a role in the creation of a new professional identity 
