 image where definitions of derivative and limit are not successfully integrated. Only category 1, 2 and 5 are correct if compared to the formal concept definition. The students’ descriptions of integrals are presented in table 4 as they responded to the task: Describe the concept of integral with your own words. - 978-90-8790-783-9
