parental i nvolvement in DHNP. The level of involvement will likely range from 
accompanying  children’s  mathematics  app  use  by  playing  together  to  simply 
monitoring  their   child’s  independent  use. Parents’  mathematics  attitudes  and 
anxiety (as already discussed in the DHNP outer model) may mediate parental 
involvement in DHNP and must also  be considered. •  Types of parental feedback. Parental feedback (i.e., discussions about mathemat-
ics arising in the game) during or following app use may also shape children’s 
