"What was the main goal behind the introduction of the license training system for coaches and trainers, as described in the ""Zweiter Weg"" resolution adopted in Duisburg in November 1959?","  kennt,  pro  Jahr  über  45.000  Vereinsmitglieder  ausweist,  die 
