vious  research   (Bragg,  2007;  Cox  &  Robinson,  2008;  Grace  et  al.,  2019). What 
stand out are the projects aimed at improving spaces in the school, both the physical 
aspects (architecture, accessibility and school playgroun d) and coexistence (in the 
classroom and the playground). A second recurring issue is related to educational organisation and management, 
