ory. First, we explain the rationale and background and thereafter elaborate on how 
the concept can be useful in research of mathematical modelling educat ion. The overall aim to use this concept in our research is to shed more light on the 
wider context of mathematical modelling education and what effect th is wider con-
text  has  on  the  teaching  and  learning  of  mathematical  modelling. We  want  to 
